    "name": "OmniStock Phase 5 - Customers, Orders & Split Allocation",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman smoke test collection for OmniStock MVP Phase 5 (User Story 3: Automated Order Allocation & Reservation). Covers Customer Management, Snapshot Preservation, Order State Machine (DRAFT -> PENDING -> ALLOCATED -> SHIPPED / CANCELLED), Deterministic Multi-Warehouse Split Allocation, All-or-Nothing Insufficient Stock Rollback, Stock Movements on Shipment, and Cross-Tenant Isolation.",
